The legal texts are Latvian legislation, as consolidated on likumi.lv by VSIA "Latvijas Vēstnesis",
the official publisher of the Republic of Latvia, and read from Internet Archive captures
(web.archive.org) whose timestamps are recorded in the corpus data and REPRODUCE.md. Amending laws'
titles and publication details are from the official gazette "Latvijas Vēstnesis" (www.vestnesis.lv).

Under the Copyright Law of Latvia (Autortiesību likums), article 6, laws and other normative acts
are not protected by copyright. Latvijas Vēstnesis states that re-use of information published in
the official gazette is to be agreed with the official publisher in writing
(https://www.vestnesis.lv/atkalizmantosana, read 29 October 2026). No such agreement has been made;
this repository is private for that reason. likumi.lv states that its consolidated texts are for
information; the official publication is the gazette.

The arrangement of this repository, its tables, commit messages and tools are by Lexifina and may be
reused under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). This repository is not legal advice and not an
official publication.
